Introduction
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Welcome to my portfolio website readme. This website was created to showcase the different projects I have created over the last few years.

Site Address
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Link[nghaigh.me](https://nghaigh.me)

Build Tools
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- HTML5/CSS3/Javascript
- Hosted On Github Pages
- Domain aquired from Namecheap


Features
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-Portfolio Showcase with links to corresponding pages
-Contact information
-Social Links
-Phone compatability
-Adaptive Navbar

How to run locally
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
To run locally you need to do the following
	-Install Visual Studio Code
	-Clone the repository onto device
	-Install liveserver extension onto Visual Studio Code
	-Open the project in Visual Studio Code and open it in a live server (Right Click Option)

